:: basement
<<scenery basement>>
You are currently in your basement.
<<unlessLateToJob>>\
    <div class="row">\
        <div class="one-half column">\
            <<if $slaves.length > 0>>\
                Slaves:
                <<set _slaveIndex to 0>>\
                <<for _slave range $slaves>>\
                    <<print "<<link '_slave.name (_slave.age y.o. _slave.hairColor hair)'>><<set $npc to " + JSON.stringify(_slave) + ", $npc.index to " + _slaveIndex + ">><<openNpcInteraction slave>><</link>>">>
                    <<set _slaveIndex++>>\
                <</for>>\
            <</if>>\
        </div>\
        <div class="one-half column">\
            <<set _avaliableBeds to Basement.avaliableBeds()>>
            <<if _avaliableBeds <= 0>>\
                There's no more room for more slaves. You need to buy matresses if you want more.
            <<else>>\
                There's room for <<- _avaliableBeds>> more slave<<if _avaliableBeds gt 1>>s<</if>>.
            <</if>>\
        </div>\
    </div>


    <<keyOption "Go back upstairs" main 🚪>>
    <<include workOption>>\
<</unlessLateToJob>>\
:: slave
<<scenery basement>>
You approach $npc.name
<<include npcStats>>
$npc.genPronoun nerviously looks at you with $npc.possesive $npc.eyeColor eyes

<<keyOption "Push $npc.pronoun down" slavePushedDown 👇>>
<<keyOption "Leave $npc.pronoun alone" basement ✋>>
:: slavePushedDown
<<scenery basement>>
You push $npc.name down placing your body over.
<<if $npc.fear gt 25>>\
    $npc.genPronoun trembles in fear under your shadow.
<</if>>\

<<keyOption "Strip $npc.pronoun naked" slaveStrip 👌>>
<<keyOption "Leave $npc.pronoun alone" basement ✋>>
:: slaveStrip
<<scenery basement>>
You take off all $npc.possesive clothes leaving $npc.name completely naked in front of you.

<<keyOption "Penetrate $npc.pronoun" slavePenetrate 🍆>>
<<keyOption "Leave $npc.pronoun alone" basement ✋>>
:: slavePenetrate
<<scenery basement>>
You forcefully push your dick inside $npc.name and start to fuck $npc.pronoun.
$npc.genPronoun starts crying and whimpering.
<<set $npc.fear to Math.min(100, $npc.fear + 50), $slaves[$npc.index].fear = $npc.fear>>\
<<include npcStats>>

<<keyOption "finish" basement ✋>>